Depending on your race, you should be able to #twoweapon.  Slashem
lets you twoweapon two artifacts.
You only gain intrinsics from the primary weapon, however.  Two-weapon
also nullifies the rogue's backstab bonus.

> So which one it is? I have Shield of Reflection, so I've got a free spot for
> Amulet of Drain Resistance, if I found one. But level-draining ability is also
