If you need to use the shield, then two-weapon is out.

Advice - avoid melee and use Elbereth combined with a +7 dagger
stack.  With the backstab bonus it kicks MAJOR ass.  Wield
Stormbringer when nothing is around you, and be prepared to use the
'x' command to switch to the Bat for melee or when close to peacefuls.

